# elvira3 1.13 - worked out by the app from the ports of The Beatles 1.29, Deadpool LE 1.14, Deadpool Pro 1.16, Godzilla Premium/LE 1.16, Godzilla Pro 1.15, Jaws LE 1.02, TMNT Pro 1.59.
# Emulator-proven 2026-09-24 by a full build check (modes/gamecheck.sh play full, item 162): the
# runtime hooked the game, 30 of its 45 shots came from their switches, a drain ended each ball, and
# the 5 events below fired where their names say (a tilted ball, three balls to the game's end).
# Shots no press made (their switch is left out of the check, or needs two): Trunk lock 1, Right 3-bank target top, Right ramp exit opto, Drop target opto, House ramp opto, House target left, House target right, Turret opto 1, Turret opto 2, Turret opto 3, Turret opto 4, Left pop bumper, Right pop bumper, Bottom pop bumper, Top lane left.
